  ],
  "eng_for_zho:pod-1:SC06-S05": [
   ["I'm from Manchester,","我来自 Manchester，","418d8eb6-3e4b-4692-8ea8-94bfb303ca93","45b8f2af-8f38-4b84-aa43-88f7836e5a14"],
   ["but I live in London now.","不过我现在住在 London。","08f542a6-076d-45ab-b296-37bee7e43bbd","0d06c667-f0da-4afb-9030-57c39d1851dc"],
