  ],
  "eng_for_zho:pod-1:SC06-S09": [
   ["I'm sorry, I didn't understand you.","对不起，我没有听懂你的话。","c6a14ba4-ca0f-44a3-ba37-e975dab3d059","29eca382-9313-4cc5-8b23-0ab3136ea80d"],
   ["I'm learning English.","我在学习英语。","479eb65d-a12c-462b-bb49-226afa45f3b9","f02d8d57-6304-4c37-a16b-85cd03eef725"],
