  ],
  "eng_for_zho:pod-1:SC06-S10": [
   ["Yes, of course.","好的，当然可以。","71191dc5-a48e-4f9e-9260-c33fb1e0aa7c","be988f6a-5d1a-472e-901d-eaf049d16535"],
