  ],
  "eng_for_zho:pod-1:SC06-S11": [
   ["I teach English,","我教英语，","10c384bf-d0f1-4dbd-9b76-a641a87a959f","501ab208-d60f-4617-8576-e44f55df0fb3"],
   ["but not in a school.","不过不是在学校教。","aa43a14a-f6e5-4a6d-9748-7fcd4994ad87","8b732e2c-d14a-413e-a3a0-eddae811fd02"],
   ["I work with adults.","我教成年人。","6270873e-d31c-45b1-8534-ab9f76c76d69","33a37209-dde0-4909-9f98-f7d15d6aeafd"],
   ["I'm on holiday here with my wife and children.","我和妻子、孩子在这里度假。","d21e5d02-75da-4d23-8dc7-88e4badb09de","f355ebe4-d9af-4ac6-95bb-d8c048caf4a5"],
