  ],
  "eng_for_zho:pod-1:SC08-S07": [
   ["We have a house red, a house white,","我们有招牌红葡萄酒、招牌白葡萄酒，","376c04b9-1a42-474f-970b-aebd1d8ced64","24546362-7251-4ff7-9d9d-9a8cfca66e87"],
   ["or you could have one of our bottles.","您也可以选一瓶我们的瓶装酒。","10f3752d-30d9-4bbb-a038-36ae81c53dfb","9919bc71-33bb-4e3b-9065-88594ee4afeb"]
  ],
  "eng_for_zho:pod-1:SC08-S12": [
   ["I'm not sure if I'm hungry.","我不确定我饿不饿。","382e6dba-cd76-41f7-b3a2-1c01cce9f16a","1243fee8-d18c-40ef-83ad-8c80cf05691e"],
   ["Do you have a menu?","您这儿有菜单吗？","77a124a2-8160-4ebc-8ade-330b5180b3d6","90c28e0c-31bf-46ae-b6aa-9e4850515177"]
  ],
  "eng_for_zho:pod-1:SC08-S13": [
   ["Yes, of course. Here it is.","有的，当然有。给您。","78135242-f24c-4d9f-9168-8827fa9ee451","b3d8c07a-701f-46c2-b7d3-0bcc66315477"],
   ["The fish and chips are very good.","我们的炸鱼薯条非常好吃。","d8772164-5c67-47d0-9fdc-e89345ac8cee","452d1d9e-52e1-4a3c-a012-a9e8e924e8e9"]
  ],
  "eng_for_zho:pod-1:SC08-S14": [
   ["Can we have some bread?","我们可以要一些面包吗？","68cdc3f2-afc9-449d-9ae8-c904a300a747","2e6e67bd-6aaa-4d92-9247-30f66d016d55"],
   ["And a bowl of chips for the table.","再来一碗薯条放在桌上一起吃。","92e72a43-ed5e-4f36-a859-006d717c98b2","d6392a86-a3c1-4e49-8f7f-46f5f0e04da6"]
