  ],
  "eng_for_zho:pod-1:SC09-S06": [
   ["Yes, the salmon and the risotto are both gluten-free.","有的，三文鱼和烩饭都是无麸质的。","cb4587ae-7ffe-41c5-8ff4-38a466e7f573","96312e46-b0f6-4450-aa69-2904e640942f"],
